    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Import your flowchart from your Backpack. Prompt the AI to generate the HTML/CSS for your web app based on your flowchart's logic. \r\n\r\n2. Write a second prompt asking the AI for the JavaScript that powers your logic.\r\n\r\n3. Interact with your new web app using different values to ensure it works correctly.\r\n\r\n4. Compare the JavaScript to your flowchart:\r\n   - Does the condition match your diamond?\r\n    - Do the `if` and `else` paths show the correct outcomes?\r\n    - Did the AI miss or add anything unexpected?",
